{"id":"chatcmpl-07eb2bc1-555f-4dde-947d-a3c2f68decc4","object":"chat.completion","created":1795246606,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a cross-validation strategy for medical image interpretation where ambiguous findings (laterality of diaphragm elevation) are confirmed by querying multiple independent expert models before committing to an answer. The pattern emphasizes redundancy through independent sources to reduce single-model error, and using targeted, finding-specific questions rather than open-ended interpretation. Consensus across independent tools is treated as sufficient evidence for a confident answer.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a finding requires disambiguation between two symmetric options (left vs right, above vs below), query multiple independent expert sources with the specific disambiguation question rather than a general description request.\",\n    \"Use targeted, finding-specific prompts that name the exact ambiguity to resolve, instead of broad 'describe the image' queries that may omit the critical detail.\",\n    \"Treat agreement between two or more independent models/tools as sufficient confidence to finalize an answer, and record the consensus rationale explicitly.\",\n    \"For lateral or oblique views where laterality is non-obvious, explicitly ask about laterality in the query to force the model to commit to a side.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical image interpretation\": \"Ask finding-specific disambiguation questions (which side, which structure) and cross-check with a second independent model before answering.\",\n    \"Binary-choice visual QA\": \"Convert the question into a direct either/or prompt for each tool, then use agreement as the decision rule.\",\n    \"Ambiguous laterality tasks\": \"Explicitly name the laterality ambiguity in the prompt so models must resolve it rather than describe generically.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the question's ambiguity (e.g., left vs right) is explicitly stated in each tool query.\",\n    \"Verify at least two independent sources agree before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":439,"total_tokens":812,"completion_tokens":373,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":439},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":373}}}